 A few of the potentially useful monsters to reverse genocide are listed.

 Dave said REVERSE genociding elves. If you read a cursed scroll of genocide
monsters of the type specified will be sent in instead of genocided. Some
good monsters to reverse genocide are Wraiths, Nurses, giants(if you have a
tinning kit), dragons ( if you want a truly masochistic way to gain shock and
disintegration resistance), electric eels ( a less masochistic way to gain
shock resistance), tengus (if you really want intrinsic teleport control),
unicorns of your own alignment, (so you can transfer your gems into luck, 
you should probably wait until you have the luckstone before you try this),
unicirns of another alignment, ( a way to get that oh so very useful unicorn
horn, if done near an altar, this is also one way to max out your alignment
for the quest).

  These suggestions are really pretty obvious, but then again I am pretty
low on the Nethack totem pole as far as skill and knowledge are concerned. 
I was wondering if there are any other useful monsters to reverse genocide,
and why it would be good to do so.

  Of course by reverse genociding elves early on, Dave is hoping he can get
sleep resistance, so those pesky Gnomes cannot put him to sleep while in their
mines.

